{"4219460": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Grimwar", "steam_appid": 4219460, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4219460/extras/a48979b9cd6f9b5f659ed2c4f0f98d2b.poster.avif?t=1785261375\" width=1170 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4219460/extras/a48979b9cd6f9b5f659ed2c4f0f98d2b.webm?t=1785261375\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4219460/extras/a48979b9cd6f9b5f659ed2c4f0f98d2b.mp4?t=1785261375\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ABOUT GRIMWAR</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grimwar is a multiplayer first-person shooter set in the 3040s. After the collapse of the old world, magic returned, and two factions now fight over the last remaining magical resources.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Union and the Order use rebuilt World War II-era technology in combination with the occult to wage a new kind of war. Players choose a class, join a team, and fight through brutal matches where positioning, teamwork, and roles matter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4219460/extras/b7acf72b4125669af3f8e13877cbfe0a.poster.avif?t=1785261375\" width=1170 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4219460/extras/b7acf72b4125669af3f8e13877cbfe0a.webm?t=1785261375\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4219460/extras/b7acf72b4125669af3f8e13877cbfe0a.mp4?t=1785261375\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CHOOSE YOUR ROLE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each class has its own purpose in battle, with different equipment, strengths, and weaknesses. Some classes are better at direct combat, while others support the team, control space, or help push objectives. Players need to use their role effectively and work with their squad to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4219460/extras/5dd4062a08f82fd851a446eeaa84a337.poster.avif?t=1785261375\" width=1170 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4219460/extras/5dd4062a08f82fd851a446eeaa84a337.webm?t=1785261375\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4219460/extras/5dd4062a08f82fd851a446eeaa84a337.mp4?t=1785261375\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Six unique classes</strong><br>Choose one of six classes, customize your loadout, and fight using a mix of weapons, equipment, and abilities built for different combat roles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4219460/extras/af2effdcc242972c0582b6f2cdb8fc7a.poster.avif?t=1785261375\" width=1170 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4219460/extras/af2effdcc242972c0582b6f2cdb8fc7a.webm?t=1785261375\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4219460/extras/af2effdcc242972c0582b6f2cdb8fc7a.mp4?t=1785261375\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple game modes</strong><br>Play across different multiplayer modes such as Blitz and Assault.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4219460/extras/30853b5a9ce085036f54edf63715cedd.poster.avif?t=1785261375\" width=1170 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4219460/extras/30853b5a9ce085036f54edf63715cedd.webm?t=1785261375\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4219460/extras/30853b5a9ce085036f54edf63715cedd.mp4?t=1785261375\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Matchmaking, ranks, and  statistics</strong><br>Queue into official servers with matchmaking support, ranked progression, stat tracking, and systems designed for competitive play. Track your performance across matches, climb matchmaking ranks, and build your profile over time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4219460/extras/49709d899e4d6d591ee694052ebc61e1.poster.avif?t=1785261375\" width=1170 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4219460/extras/49709d899e4d6d591ee694052ebc61e1.webm?t=1785261375\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4219460/extras/49709d899e4d6d591ee694052ebc61e1.mp4?t=1785261375\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Custom content, servers, and modding support</strong><br>Grimwar is built with community creativity in mind, including support for custom content. Use the Grimwar SDK to create custom maps and expand the game with community-made content.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4219460/extras/2a6890cabc6e46d6ccc24222eda868a6.poster.avif?t=1785261375\" width=1170 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4219460/extras/2a6890cabc6e46d6ccc24222eda868a6.webm?t=1785261375\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4219460/extras/2a6890cabc6e46d6ccc24222eda868a6.mp4?t=1785261375\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CURRENT DEVELOPMENT STATUS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grimwar is currently in early development. The current version is focused on testing the core multiplayer experience, including movement, shooting, class roles, combat flow, maps, and server stability.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Access is limited to invited testers through our closed playtest program. Features, balance, visuals, audio, and content are still being developed and may change as the game evolves.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4219460/extras/a48979b9cd6f9b5f659ed2c4f0f98d2b.poster.avif?t=1785261375\" width=1170 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4219460/extras/a48979b9cd6f9b5f659ed2c4f0f98d2b.webm?t=1785261375\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4219460/extras/a48979b9cd6f9b5f659ed2c4f0f98d2b.mp4?t=1785261375\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ABOUT GRIMWAR</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grimwar is a multiplayer first-person shooter set in the 3040s. After the collapse of